        "snippet": "Xcel Brands, Inc. (NASDAQ: XELB) – Q1 2026 Earnings\n\n# InfoArb Sheets\n\nSubscribeSign in\n\n# Xcel Brands, Inc. (NASDAQ: XELB) – Q1 2026 Earnings\n\nMay 29, 2026\n\nShare\n\n### Xcel Brands, Inc. (NASDAQ: XELB) – Q1 2026 Earnings\n\n###### Press release and earnings call link\n\n## Section 1: Short Tear Sheeet\n\n---\n\nXcel Brands is a microcap media and consumer products company built around brand licensing, live shopping, interactive television, social commerce, and influencer-led consumer brands. Its revenue is primarily licensing revenue tied to brands sold through channels such as QVC, HSN, e-commerce, brick-and-mortar retailers, and live-stream shopping platforms. The company is currently in a turnaround/repositioning phase: revenue declined 14% YoY in Q1 2026 to $1.1 million, but management is trying to shift the story from legacy brand monetization to a new creator-led brand portfolio with over 46 million social followers and a goal of reaching 100 million. The key near-term themes are brand l",
